Good honours Degree (minimum Second Class Lower) in Civil, Electrical or Mechanical Engineering, Architecture, Quantity Surveying or Building Technology from a recognized university;
Membership registration of COREN, CORBON, QSRBN, TOPREC, ARCON, CORLOR or any other relevant professional bodies;
Minimum of fifteen (15) years cognate experience, five (5) of which shall be in a senior position most of which preferably mustbe in University or relevant Institution of higher learning
