Applicant must also be conversant with the procurement Act 2007 University Contract 2004, University Contract Management and tender procedures. In addition applicant must be duly revealed with the relevant profession regulating body like COREN, QSRBN, ARCON,. Position of a higher degree in relevant field will bean added advantage.
