Embrace and drives a culture of continuous process improvement across the finance functions and the wider business;
Assess the financial teams training needs and ensure prompt bridging of identified gaps by informing HR of relevant training programs;
Ensure all financial practices are in line with all statutory legislation and financial regulations.
The primary driver of financial effectiveness and efficiency;
Ensure adherence to defined Human Resources (HR) policies and procedures;
